# The Franking Works' press line 4 (CIPlay franking_works_spikes, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (the origin frame): the press frankpress at 24 -51.5, the bed's pins fwspike on 22.5..25.5 x -48..-45,
# the hazard zone fwbed at 24 -46.5 (r 3.4, spikes, safe=none, pulse 2 s up / 3 s down), the warning sign fwwarn at 19.2 -46.5, the
# stop lever fwlever at 29.4 -44.4. Into the bed: hurt and the message; the lever: bed and pins hidden; across unhurt.
# Offline-written, never run; the yard is ~2.5 m, all on the ground.
island The Franking Works keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
expect shown fwbed
expect shown fwspike

picture fw_press 14 +3.5 -58 24 +1.2 -47
walk 15 -46.5 to 18 -46.5
read PRESS LINE 4

# Into the bed, through a whole stroke
walk 19 -46.5 to 21.6 -46.5
wait 7
expect message registration pins
expect hurt 4
at 15 -46.5
picture fw_pins 20 +2.5 -43 24 +0.3 -46.5
wait 4
expect unhurt

# The lever stops it
use fwlever
wait 2
expect hidden fwbed
expect hidden fwspike
expect message pins drop away
wait 3
walk 18 -46.5 to 24 -46.5 to 28 -46.5
wait 4
expect unhurt
